-- template's face; no kerning and no ligatures, as both engines set it), in 1/1000 em, as typst measures the
-- vendored metric-compatible face. A line typst fills to within a hundredth of a point may count differently;
-- the cross-engine gate (XENG-002, -003) would show it.
